the LISC Small Business Relief &amp; Recovery Fund Application.\u00a0<strong>To take the survey \u2013 Click <\/strong><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/forms.office.com\/Pages\/ResponsePage.aspx?id=ppPDOZsD50ug6wsDDbE1tk0Wk_H7BptFgfGAIyGxfCJUM0xXSFJQNk8zWlhJSEFIQzRQSVJYVzE0VC4u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here<\/a><\/span><strong>.<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Eligibility Criteria\/Basic Requirements:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022Minority-owned business<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022Annual revenue of less than $500,000<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022Fewer than 20 employees<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022Located in New York City<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022Formally registered and in business for at least one year<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">For more details, on application, and how to complete, contact our Business Resource Center, Monday &#8211; Friday, 9am to 5pm. Our Business Resource Center will assist with application. Please feel free to email<\/span> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"mailto:ehelpdesk@rdrc.org\">ehelpdesk@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span>. <span style=\"color: #000080;\">Or contact Victoria Stukes, Business Resource Center Project Manager, at 718.327.5300 and ask for a Business Resource Center Specialist.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>LISC NYC SMALL BUSINESS GRANT OPPORTUNITY<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":959,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-907","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/907","targetHints":{"allow":["